d:An old control unit recovered from a decommissioned Ash Army vault, older than the system software now running on it. It accepts one deposit and seals itself for good. One deposit is all you are given; make it count, work the unit apart from the inside with the few parts it still trusts, and bring up a prompt of your own.

<br>

Flag format: **`CSCTF{...}`**
